        },
        {
          "text": "And I saw what appeared to be a sea of glass mingled with fire, and those who had conquered the beast and its image and the number of its name, standing beside the sea of glass with harps of God in their hands. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
